-<a id="workspace-level-roles"></a>
+## Workspace-Level Roles
+
+Workspace roles govern tenancy defaults, administrative delegation, and cross-project visibility:
+
+- **Workspace Admin:** Holds full administrative authority across all projects, custom fields, user groups, and workflows within the workspace. Enforces AAL2 step-up for user lifecycle mutations and trash restoration.
+- **Workspace Member:** Baseline contributor role assigned to standard enterprise users. Can create and participate in projects where granted explicit project membership.
+- **Workspace Viewer:** Auditing and stakeholder role with read-only visibility into workspace settings, public projects, and shared documentation.
+- **Workspace Guest:** Restricted access tier for external contractors and vendors. Has no ambient visibility into workspace member lists or project catalogs; visibility is granted exclusively through direct resource ACL grants.
+
+Role inheritance is strictly additive except where explicit DENY masks are applied. A user who is a Workspace Member can be elevated to Project Admin on specific projects without granting broader workspace administration privileges.
+
