 10. **2-Stage Destructive Confirmation:** Permanent purge is exclusively gated to `SERVER_ADMIN` + fresh AAL2. It requires `POST /api/v1/admin/destructive:request` to compute blast radius and mint an ephemeral HMAC `confirmation_token` + `blast_hash`, followed by `POST /api/v1/admin/destructive:execute` with a mandatory human reason (10 to 500 characters).
 11. **Project-Level Role Delegation:** Project Admins may manage role bindings within their designated project only. They cannot elevate users to Workspace Admin or Server Admin.
