+The Multi-Card Authentication Studio (`/admin/auth`) and Granular RBAC Policy Builder configure enterprise identity providers, Active Directory / LDAPS trees, OpenID Connect SSO, WebAuthn Passkeys, TOTP multi-factor authentication, break-glass lockout prevention, and 30-permission custom roles.
